{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>berkbrain 是一款以人工智能進行影像分割的產品攝影工具，能將商品或主體從背景中分離，並快速製作多種乾淨背景版本。適合網店賣家、小型商戶、內容創作者，以及需要統一商品圖片風格的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-5.webp\">\n<h2>人工智能一鍵去背</h2>\n<p>拍攝後點選要保留的主體，再以納入及排除點微調遮罩，即可生成最多五個背景版本，包括純白、中性色與淺藍色。程式支援以工作階段整理相片、拍攝正方形高解像度商品圖，並可匯出單張影像或整個工作階段，格式為 JPG 或 PNG，亦可經 AirDrop、Files、iCloud Drive 等分享。所有處理均在裝置上完成。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-268-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-269-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-270-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-271-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-272-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-273-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：berkbrain</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.259762+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:03:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:03.865777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:10.446514+00:00","content_hash":"6fb2644e81479a18b8dd30f04ad93d97ff2cddce5b9eda4a7b368f4a0ef1a120","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}